# Development defaults, committed on purpose.
#
# Every value here is public (it is inlined into the dev bundle) and belongs to the
# Meta Poo Privy app, not the VenekoVox one. The app secret is server-only and lives in
# Bitwarden; nothing in this file is a credential.
#
# Why committed: `web/.env` is gitignored, so a per-machine `.env` made social login
# appear or vanish depending on who had hand-edited it. `npm run dev` must work on a
# fresh checkout. Anything in `.env` still wins for that machine, and `.env.local`
# (written by `vercel link`) wins over both.
VITE_PRIVY_ENABLED=true
VITE_PRIVY_APP_ID=cmw9wgh0f00500gkxkxsjy2hg
# Same-origin, no query, no hash: config.ts rejects anything else. Relative is fine —
# it is resolved against the page origin.
VITE_PRIVY_SIGN_PAGE_URL=/privy-sign.html
